&lt;td rowspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ Ｐ明朝&amp;apos;;"&gt;対象となる&lt;br/&gt;役員の員数&lt;br/&gt;（名）&lt;/p&gt;
